-- https://wiki.hypr.land/Configuring/Basics/Variables/#misc
-- Enable VRR (adaptive sync) for fullscreen apps only. Fixes camera-pan jitter
-- in Dota 2 and other games: without it, an uncapped/variable framerate gets
-- forced into a rigid 240Hz refresh by the compositor, causing frame-pacing
-- stutter.
--
-- Must stay 2, not 1. With VRR always on, Hyprland falls back to software
-- cursors (hyprctl monitors -> hardwareCursorsInUse: false) and the pointer is
-- redrawn at the desktop's variable, often low, refresh rate instead of riding
-- the display's cursor plane. That reads as a floaty/laggy mouse no amount of
-- accel_profile = "flat" can fix.
hl.config({
  misc = {
    vrr = 2,
  },
})

